    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Magic Forest and Nimble Warrior - an intuitive 2D platformer game where you play as a nimble warrior. The platforms that the character must jump on appear and disappear at certain points in time according to a timer. Have time to jump over before the ground goes out from under your feet!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe charming pixel graphics and atmospheric music create a captivating yet relaxing game experience. The gameplay is addictive and engaging, but not annoying. This platformer is perfect to relax after a hard day. Intuitive controls allow you to immediately immerse yourself in the game without long introductions or complicated instructions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Charming pixel art graphics<br />\r\n    Atmospheric music<br />\r\n    Engaging and addictive gameplay<br />\r\n    Simple and intuitive controls<br />\r\n    Dynamic platform challenges",
